football field. So how does
something that big stay

4
00:00:09,433 --> 00:00:10,567
hidden underwater?

5
00:00:11,233 --> 00:00:13,633
Water carries sound
remarkably well.

6
00:00:13,633 --> 00:00:16,767
Low-frequency sound loses
very little energy to

7
00:00:16,767 --> 00:00:20,267
absorption, so low rumbles
can be detected a long way

8
00:00:20,267 --> 00:00:23,200
