9
00:00:23,867 --> 00:00:26,967
Many submarines are wrapped
in special coatings.

10
00:00:26,967 --> 00:00:29,167
Some soak up incoming sonar
pings,

11
00:00:29,167 --> 00:00:32,667
so less sound echoes back.
Others muffle the noise the

12
00:00:32,667 --> 00:00:33,833
boat itself makes.

13
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,500
It doesn't make a submarine
silent.

14
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:39,100
It makes it harder to hear
and harder to find.
